      "sourceTextSha256": "08497490c6919df9565ab7403e4b9c2209e05b23b2a9279e8716e535649be2d6",
      "text": "Day 5 · 07:00 breakfast · 08:00 jungle walk and visit to a caboclo’s house, learning how manioc flour is prepared · 12:00 lunch · 15:00 visit to the village of Acajatuba, whose people live from manioc plantations, fishing and fruits such as tucumã, cupuaçu and açaí, as well as rubber and Brazil-nut trees, and make crafts with natural seeds from the jungle · 19:00 farewell dinner · 20:00 explore the riverbank by searchlight to spot caimans, and sometimes nighthawks, snakes and frogs. Activities may vary according to the lodge and the season.",
